From f0e7adaa3a3a7bbd1f354ed86d75b84ff0ad83cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:29:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] release: re-point release path from upstream fork to this
 repository (R-1,R-2,R-3,R-6)

- release.yml: repository gate now matches Charteredprofessionals/Cworkspace,
  so the release pipeline actually runs here instead of silently no-oping;
  Homebrew tap, formula URLs, AUR source/URLs and maintainer identity
  re-pointed to this repo and its git identity.
- scripts/install.sh: REPO now this repository. The optional
  JCODE_RELEASE_METADATA_BASE mirror stays configurable; version lookup,
  download bases and SHA256SUMS verification all already fall back to the
  GitHub release itself, so installation works without jcode.sh.
- jcode update (update.rs GITHUB_REPO) and selfdev repo URL now point at
  Charteredprofessionals/Cworkspace, so published binaries self-update to
  THIS project's releases.
- publish-typescript-sdk.yml: publish under the
  @charteredprofessionals npm scope and wire NODE_AUTH_TOKEN (was absent,
  so both npm publish steps could never authenticate). SDK package names,
  optionalDependencies and READMEs renamed accordingly.
- windows-installer.yml: fix invalid PowerShell -Filter syntax (was
  -Filter "*.msi","*.exe"), remove the v* tag push trigger that raced
  release.yml on the same tags.

label-pr.yml keeps the upstream jev-pr-labeler action (public, works from
any repository). Requires repo setup: NPM_TOKEN secret, npm org, Homebrew
tap fork, AUR account.
